 in the `LanguageServer.create` method\n4. write minor tests\n\nThe subclasses are typically easy to write, have a look at the \n[PyrightLanguageServer](src/multilspy/language_servers/pyright_language_server/pyright_server.py) \nfor an example, or at any other implementation to see how non-python\ndependencies for language servers are handled there.\nThere are also some tips from the multilspy admin [here](https://github.com/microsoft/multilspy/issues/5)."}},{"id":"60b9439f-28ca-474c-89e2-4b6e05131d28","values":[-0.04123996943235397,-0.09810303151607513,0.03928295150399208,-0.003446937073022127,0.04260196164250374,-0.030887048691511154,-0.02165202796459198,0.025002872571349144,-0.0008773996378295124,-0.026751689612865448,0.06350814551115036,-0.009517854079604149,-0.0114582609385252,0.0074752564541995525,0.04720917344093323,0.00447550043463707,0.00619468092918396,0.018252097070217133,0.01280011422932148,-0.01877441816031933,0.0845196470618248,0.030814029276371002,0.0014031996252015233,0.013315167278051376,0.0749792754650116,-0.007085355464369059,-0.0536043755710125,-0.0031355428509414196,0.05462701618671417,-0.0151376249268651,0.02057473547756672,0.09637098759412766,-0.05719384551048279,0.005008224863559008,0.09149815142154694,0.047527868300676346,0.035043228417634964,-0.09432707726955414,0.07097261399030685,0.028213627636432648,-0.059434838593006134,-0.08224954456090927,0.012656678445637226,0.000622760911937803,-0.05739303678274155,0.03732188418507576,0.025152023881673813,0.03245300054550171,-0.022139722481369972,-0.006736729759722948,-0.005342534743249416,-0.04958539083600044,-0.019264966249465942,-0.030261890962719917,-0.05690470710396767,-0.08883046358823776,0.020117413252592087,0.03745950013399124,-0.07707677781581879,-0.05351649969816208,-0.1163182258605957,0.09601501375436783,0.05417869612574577,0.062010258436203,-0.058376457542181015,0.0357317216694355,-0.0001892351865535602,-0.018642757087945938,0.06152715906500816,-0.020907724276185036,-0.13116143643856049,